    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d107">

                <pb facs="0219" n="113" sameAs="frus:frus1906p1/pg113"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        Ambassador Griscom.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1906-11-17"><hi rendition="#italic">November 17,
                        1906</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Express the thanks of this Government and of myself personally to President Penna
                    for the kind and helpful expressions of his inaugural address.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Root.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
